From: dm1q mainline port <dm1q-mainline@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add Samsung S6E3FAC AMB606AW01 panel driver

DSI command-mode AMOLED panel of the Samsung Galaxy S23 (dm1q): 1080x2340,
120 Hz, 4 lanes, DSC 1.1 (2 slices of 540x117, 8 bpc, 8 bpp).

The init sequence is what the Samsung bootloader sends on the wire for this
panel (its log, notes/2026-10-13-display-bringup/xbl-display-init.txt),
cross-checked against the command scripts of Samsung's downstream devicetree.
Gamma/ACL/IRC/mdnie/VRR handling is not ported; brightness uses DCS 0x51
(11 bit, 0x07ff = full). The DSC parameters are left to the msm DSI host, which
derives exactly the PPS Samsung sends (checked by hand, docs/09). The 120 Hz
mode reproduces Samsung's 951.08 Mbit/s lane rate through dsi_host.c.

Structure follows panel-samsung-ana38407.c of the gts9uwifi port.

Not tested on hardware at the time of writing.

Signed-off-by: dm1q mainline port <dm1q-mainline@example.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6da6abb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,81 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/display/panel/samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: Samsung S6E3FAC DDIC with AMB606AW01 AMOLED panel
+
+maintainers:
+  - dm1q mainline port <dm1q-mainline@example.com>
+
+description:
+  6.1 inch 1080x2340 AMOLED panel of the Samsung Galaxy S23 (SM-S911B),
+  driven by the S6E3FAC display driver IC over four DSI lanes in command
+  mode with DSC.
+
+allOf:
+  - $ref: panel-common.yaml#
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01
+
+  reg:
+    maxItems: 1
+
+  vdd3-supply:
+    description: 1.8 V supply (panel_vdd3)
+
+  vci-supply:
+    description: 3.0 V supply (panel_vci)
+
+  vddr-supply:
+    description: 1.3 V supply (panel_vddr)
+
+  reset-gpios: true
+  te-gpios: true
+  port: true
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - reg
+  - vdd3-supply
+  - vci-supply
+  - vddr-supply
+  - reset-gpios
+  - port
+
+unevaluatedProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    #include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>
+
+    dsi {
+        #address-cells = <1>;
+        #size-cells = <0>;
+
+        panel@0 {
+            compatible = "samsung,s6e3fac-amb606aw01";
+            reg = <0>;
+
+            vdd3-supply = <&panel_vdd3>;
+            vci-supply = <&panel_vci>;
+            vddr-supply = <&panel_vddr>;
+
+            reset-gpios = <&tlmm 125 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+            te-gpios = <&tlmm 86 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+
+            pinctrl-0 = <&sde_dsi_active>, <&sde_te>;
+            pinctrl-1 = <&sde_dsi_suspend>, <&sde_te>;
+            pinctrl-names = "default", "sleep";
+
+            port {
+                panel_in: endpoint {
+                    remote-endpoint = <&mdss_dsi0_out>;
+                };
+            };
+        };
+    };
+...
